---
title: Passive skill — one proposal and verified result
---
flowchart TD
  accTitle: One bounded movement proposal and its evidence
  accDescr: A passive skill checks retained visible evidence, settled route history and original budgets. A separate caller owns authority and dispatches one primitive. The exact correlated native result is retained and checked, producing cumulative verified progress and a stop or completion. Unknown results stop without replay. This skill does not dispatch or automatically resume.
  E[Retained visible evidence and original task budgets] --> S[Passive movement skill]
  S -->|One frozen proposal| C[Caller rechecks authority and reserves evidence]
  C -->|One input| N[Controller and native CDDA]
  N -->|Exact action receipt and frame| R[Caller correlates identities and retains evidence]
  R --> V[Skill checks displacement and final guard]
  V --> P[Verified progress plus stop or completion]
  R -->|Missing or uncertain outcome| U[Unknown stop — no replay]
